        <mxCell id="AeyciTAO7B4PmubfEo_D-18" parent="AeyciTAO7B4PmubfEo_D-17" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;rotation=0;strokeWidth=1;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=16;textDirection=ltr;spacingBottom=3;spacingTop=8;" value="- Improve processing or add logic to parsing that renders more structured text with&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;understanding of header-footer, as well as paragraphing.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Write a better chunking strategy to chunk only on paragraphs, worst case on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;lines. Never in between lines or words leaving poor context.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- YOLO Layout Detector to detect images; crop them; get text description generated.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Implement BM25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Generate Finetuning Dataset from processed text.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- LLM Response should show references based on Chunk Metadata (File&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Name, Page Number, Paragraph Number).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
